STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → skeleton bar rows (P4 leaf; the web renders nothing until data).
  empty    → "No vehicle battery data yet" with a friendly glyph (web `bars.length === 0 ⇒ null`), never blank.
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf; the web silently drops failed per-vehicle fetches).
  data     → one battery bar per vehicle with a resolved state (name + colour-coded fill + level% + range).
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over last-known bars; no auto-refresh.

